    "description": "Read the append-only audit trail across both backends, filtered by job, agent, run or event type. Use it to explain what happened during a run; use job_get for the outcome alone. A non-admin caller must scope this to a jobId, agentId or runId they can see — there is no unscoped view of everyone’s events.",
